# 🚘 BMW Sales Analysis Dashboard | Power BI

> **Transforming BMW sales data into interactive business insights through data visualization, DAX, and analytical storytelling.** 📊

---

## 📌 Project Overview

The **BMW Sales Analysis Dashboard** is an interactive **Power BI business intelligence project** developed to analyze BMW sales performance across **models, regions, fuel types, transmission types, pricing, mileage, engine size, sales volume, and time**.

The dashboard transforms raw automotive sales data into a **clear, interactive, and business-focused analytical experience**, allowing users to quickly understand overall performance and then drill down into individual BMW models.

The project follows a simple analytical journey:

**🌍 Overall Performance → 🚘 Model Comparison → 📈 Trend Analysis → 🔍 Detailed Model Insights → 💡 Business Recommendations**

---

## 🎯 Project Objective

The primary objective of this project is to answer important business questions through interactive visual analytics:

* 🌎 **Which regions generate the highest revenue and unit sales?**
* 🚘 **Which BMW models perform best across different markets?**
* ⚡ **Which fuel types dominate the sales mix?**
* ⚙️ **How are transmission types distributed across models?**
* 📈 **How have revenue and unit sales changed over time?**
* 🔍 **Which model–region combinations show stronger or weaker performance?**
* 💰 **How do average price, mileage, and engine size vary across models?**

