## 🧹 Data Exploration & Preparation

Before developing the dashboard, the dataset was reviewed to understand its **structure, fields, data types, and analytical suitability**.

The preparation process included:

* 🔎 Reviewing the dataset structure and available fields
* 🔢 Validating numerical data types
* 📅 Reviewing date/year fields for time analysis
* 🌍 Assigning appropriate geographic classifications
* 🏷️ Validating categorical fields such as model, region, fuel type, transmission, and classification
* 📊 Ensuring numerical fields could be aggregated correctly
* ✅ Preparing the data for Power BI visualization and DAX calculations

This step helped ensure that the data was correctly interpreted before creating the analytical visuals.

