# 📊 Dashboard Overview

The dashboard is organized into **two primary analytical experiences**.

## 🏠 1. Executive Summary

The Executive Summary provides a **high-level overview of BMW's sales performance**.

### Includes:

* 💰 Total Revenue KPI
* 🚗 Total Units Sold KPI
* 📈 Revenue trends
* 📊 Unit-sales trends
* 🌍 Regional sales analysis
* ⚡ Fuel-type distribution
* ⚙️ Transmission analysis
* 🚘 Model-wise revenue comparison
* 🏷️ Sales classification analysis

This page is designed to help stakeholders understand the **overall BMW sales picture at a glance**.

---

## 🔍 2. Detailed Model Analysis

The detailed analysis page allows users to select an individual BMW model and explore its performance in greater depth.

### Model-level analysis includes:

* 💰 Revenue
* 🚗 Units Sold
* 💵 Average Price
* 🛣️ Average Mileage
* ⚙️ Average Engine Size
* 🌍 Regional performance
* 🏷️ Sales classification
* ⚡ Fuel-type distribution
* 🔄 Transmission split
* 📈 Revenue trends
* 📊 Unit-sales trends
* 🖼️ Model images and visual elements

Interactive filtering and drill-through functionality allow users to move from **overall performance to individual model insights**.

