# 🧮 DAX & Measures

To make the dashboard dynamic and interactive, several **DAX measures** were created.

### Key Measures

```text
Average Engine Size
Average Mileage
Average Price
Total Revenue
Total Units Sold
```

These measures allow KPIs and visuals to dynamically respond to **model, region, year, fuel type, transmission, and other filters**.

