# 📈 Visualizations Used

The dashboard combines multiple visual techniques to make the analysis intuitive and easy to interpret.

### 💳 KPI Cards

Used to communicate major performance indicators such as **revenue, units sold, average price, mileage, and engine size**.

### 🌍 Geographic Map

Provides a visual representation of **BMW sales performance across regions**.

### 📈 Line Charts

Used to analyze **revenue and unit-sales trends over time**.

### 📊 Bar Charts

Used for **model-wise revenue comparisons and regional sales classification**.

### 🍩 Donut Charts

Used to analyze **fuel-type and transmission distributions**.

### 🎛️ Interactive Filters

Allow users to dynamically explore the dashboard based on **model, region, year, fuel type, and other dimensions**.

### 🔍 Drill-Through Analysis

Allows users to move from the executive dashboard into a **detailed model-specific analysis**.

### 🖼️ Model Images

Added to provide additional visual context and create a more engaging **model-level dashboard experience**.

