# 📖 Data Storytelling Approach

The dashboard was designed around a **progressive storytelling structure**.

### 1️⃣ Start with the Big Picture

The Executive Summary establishes the overall business performance through **KPIs and high-level trends**.

### 2️⃣ Identify Performance Drivers

Model and regional comparisons help identify **which products and markets contribute to sales performance**.

### 3️⃣ Explore Customer Preferences

Fuel type, transmission, and color analysis provide additional context around **vehicle preferences**.

### 4️⃣ Investigate Individual Models

The detailed model page allows users to drill into the performance of a specific BMW vehicle.

### 5️⃣ Convert Insights into Action

The final objective is to use these patterns to identify **potential market opportunities, product strategies, and areas requiring further investigation**.

